'''Li'l Valkyrie Dark''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] who joined the Cat Army in [[Version 8.6 Update|Version 8.6]] and would be unlocked when rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[NEO Best of the Best (Gacha Event)|NEO Best of the Best]] banner. Just like the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] and [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] exclusives, she is the dark counterpart to [[Li'l Valkyrie (Uber Rare Cat)|Li'l Valkyrie]] and would offer a different set of stats to differentiate from her original counterpart. Li'l Valkyrie Dark would then be implemented into [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.5 Update|Patch 1.0.5]] but is <u>only</u> obtained in the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version via Package Version Bonus.

